、更低損耗」。當資料傳輸速度持續提升，PCB上的電訊號頻率也會跟著升高，傳統E-glass玻纖材料因介電常數與介電損耗較高，在高速傳輸時容易產生訊號衰減、延遲與發熱，影響伺服器、交換器甚至是衛星通訊的穩定性。","sentiment":0,"tags":{"topics":["AI/半導體"],"bull":[],"bear":[],"score":0,"highlights":[],"keywords":[]},"time":"10/23 23:37"},{"id":"f9d52386e75a7904","source":"永豐金證券","category":"台股","title":"【1021台股盤前】大盤開低走高震盪加劇！融資浮額待降溫，META、TESLA財報即將來臨，夜盤大漲634點，主本比排行鎖定【富喬】、【德宏】、【律勝】｜豐雲學堂2026 年 10 月","link":"https://news.google.?oc=5","published":1792488248,"summary":"【1021台股盤前】大盤開低走高震盪加劇！融資浮額待降溫，META、TESLA財報即將來臨，夜盤大漲634點，主本比排行鎖定【富喬】、【德宏】、【律勝】｜豐雲學堂2026 年 10 月 永豐金證券","sentiment":1,"tags":{"topics":["法說/展望","金融","盤前"],"bull":["大漲"],"bear":[],"score":2,"highlights":[],"keywords":[]},"time":"10/20 17:24"}],"fund":{"code":"1815","rev_month":"11509","rev":938542.0,"rev_mom":2.865190705830776,"rev_yoy":82.1407223977457,"rev_cum_yoy":54.874989078215194,"eps_q":2.24,"eps_year":"115","eps_season":"2","net_income":1300461.0,"pe":40.29,"pb":5.94,"yield":0.72,"updated":"2026-10-25 00:33"},"tdcc":{"latest":{"date":"2026-10-22","big1000":54.29,"big400":58.88,"retail":21.9,"holders":155385},"prev":{"date":"2026-10-08","big1000":51.3,"big400":54.82,"retail":24.59,"holders":143258},"d_big1000":2.99,"d_big400":4.06,"d_retail":-2.69,"d_holders":12127},"weekly":{"bars":[{"time":"2026-07-27","open":73.3,"high":75.2,"low":59.1,"close":66.3,"volume":71204.968},{"time":"2026-08-03","open":66.0,"high":91.9,"low":65.6,"close":85.9,"volume":141274.921},{"time":"2026-08-10","open":86.0,"high":93.9,"low":85.1,"close":91.5,"volume":71574.235},{"time":"2026-08-17","open":93.0,"high":112.5,"low":91.1,"close":112.0,"volume":380444.315},{"time":"2026-08-24","open":113.0,"high":128.0,"low":102.5,"close":125.5,"volume":416494.159},{"time":"2026-08-31","open":124.0,"high":139.5,"low":114.0,"close":118.5,"volume":444385.299},{"time":"2026-09-07","open":124.0,"high":141.5,"low":122.0,"close":127.5,"volume":345412.433},{"time":"2026-09-14","open":126.0,"high":127.0,"low":111.0,"close":119.5,"volume":294195.85099999997